    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">10 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Tree DFS</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Compare two trees</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/same-tree/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 100</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Same Tree</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Walk both trees in lock-step. At each pair of positions: both null -> equal; exactly one null -> different; values differ -> different; otherwise the answer is \"left pair equal AND right pair equal\". O(n) time, O(h) stack. The template behind Symmetric Tree, Subtree of Another Tree and Flip Equivalence.</p>\n"
